  "title": "Baked Lemon-Garlic Tilapia and Potatoes in Foil",
  "description": "Tilapia, potatoes, and bell pepper are cooked in foil with lemon and garlic for a simple meal that is on the table in 30 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-10-05T00:39:51-04:00",
